<title>GERMANY: Hesse Jan CPI up 0.4 pct m/m, up 1.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Hesse Jan CPI up 0.4 pct m/m, up 1.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The statistics office of the German state of Hesse reported the following consumer prices changes for January.</p>
<p>    Cost of living		   January	  December</p>
<p>    Mth/mth (pct change)	    +0.4		+0.3</p>
<p>    Year/year			   +1.6		+1.4</p>
<p>Note - These data are later combined with data from three other major German states to calculate the preliminary inflation figure for the whole of west Germany.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
